{
  "id": "movie-line-shadowing",
  "src": "D:/workspaces/每日英语台词",
  "srcEnv": "MOVIE_LINE_SRC",
  "dest": "public/tools/english/movie-line-shadowing",
  "_note": "本工具的 3 个 JSON（tool/data.json / tool/zh.json / tool/voices/manifest.json）需从真源 386 条去重为 368 条，属内容变换，逐字节镜像器做不到，故**不列入 include**（include 只镜像逐字节一致的：根 *.mp4、tool/index.html、tool/voices/*.mp3）；这 3 个 JSON 由 scripts/gen-mls-data.mjs 生成，并挂在 package.json 的 prebuild **末步**（在 sync-tools 之后执行，保证最终产物为去重版 368）。",
  "include": [
    "*.mp4",
    "tool/index.html",
    "tool/voices/*.mp3"
  ],
  "exclude": [
    "**/_qa/**",
    "**/__pycache__/**",
    "**/*.py",
    "**/*.part",
    "**/.*",
    "_audit/**",
    "_logs/**",
    "_zh/**",
    "_taxonomy/**",
    "_orphan_voices/**",
    "audio/**",
    "audio_norm/**",
    "tool_phrase/**",
    "_preview.html",
    "_run_all.sh",
    "_run_tts.sh",
    "一切皆有可能(1).mp4",
    "久仰大名(1).mp4",
    "你怎么了(1).mp4",
    "你想得美(1).mp4",
    "加油1.mp4",
    "及时行乐(1).mp4",
    "在努力一点(1).mp4",
    "恕我直言(1).mp4",
    "我向你保证(1).mp4",
    "我对你一见钟情1.mp4",
    "我无能为力1.mp4",
    "振作起来(1).mp4",
    "改天吧(1).mp4",
    "时间不等人1.mp4",
    "时间会证明一切(1).mp4",
    "活在当下1.mp4",
    "祝贺你(1).mp4",
    "重新开始1.mp4",
    "随便看看1.mp4"
  ],
  "rename": {
    "你真美1.mp4": "你真美.mp4",
    "你鼓舞了我1.mp4": "你鼓舞了我.mp4",
    "我们扯平了1.mp4": "我们扯平了.mp4"
